# Tex Coords: (u, v)
# ----- ----- ----- ----- ----- ----- ----- ----- ----- ----- #
# Top left
vt 0.0 0.0

# Top Right
vt 1.0 0.0

# Bottom Left
vt 0.0 1.0

# Bottom Right
vt 1.0 1.0
